<title>JAPAN: Japan March silver imports up 6.4 pct yr/yr -- MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan March silver imports up 6.4 pct yr/yr -- MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's silver imports in March rose 6.4 percent from a year earlier to 91.95 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The figures released by MOF were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Mar 97    Feb 97	Mar 96</p>
<p> Total		91.95	84.69	 86.43</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Mexico	     73.95	35.93	 17.98</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first three months of 1997</p>
<p>totalled 296.80 tonnes against 289.56 tonnes in the same period</p>
<p>a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
